mjx-mo></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo accent=\"false\" stretchy=\"false\">→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∞</mi><mo>.</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Among the given options, the only phase portrait satisfying these conditions is the following:</p>\n<div id=\"graphic-335f14cfe4745982ab681aad6dc2c846\" class=\"graphic\"><img src=\"/graphics/335f14cfe4745982ab681aad6dc2c846\"></div></div></div>",
